Insurance Inspector

TranStar Technical Services is a professional independent fee service company providing commercial insurance inspections and loss control surveys throughout the Southeast.&nbsp; TranStar is a family owned business founded in 1994.&nbsp; We have over 40 years&rsquo; experience in the insurance business.&nbsp;


We are a dynamic growing company and we are currently seeking part time, contract commercial loss control inspectors in your area.&nbsp;&nbsp; We can keep you busy with loss control inspections across all lines of coverage in all types of occupancies.&nbsp; We specialize in commercial inspections so commercial loss control experience is required.&nbsp; We have an online reporting system that makes it easier to submit reports by having automatic recommendations and batch photo uploads.&nbsp; As long as you are &ldquo;connected" filling out forms can be done in the field decreasing time spent at home completing reports.&nbsp;

IMMEDIATE OPENINGS&nbsp;

SECURITY OFFICERS Needed in Harrisburg Area

Dental/Vision/Life/Disability Insurance

Selected individuals will be interviewed in person locally in your area.
Applicants must successfully pass a criminal record check in compliance with the PA Private Detective Act.

APPLICANTS WITH CORRECTIONAL FACILITY EXPERIENCE PREFERRED.


Responsibilities of Security Officer / Guard&nbsp;
&bull; Patrol facility or man post as instructed and serve as a general security presence and visible deterrent to crime and client rule infractions.&nbsp;
&bull; Detect suspicious activities or client rule infractions at or near assigned post which may be a threat to the property, client or employees at the site.&nbsp;
&bull; Report all incidents, accidents or medical emergencies.&nbsp;
&bull; Respond to emergencies such as fire and intrusion by following emergency response proceedings.&nbsp;
&bull; Conduct searches of visitors and residents

