Pueblo Norte, A Five Star Quality Care Community, is seeking someone who enjoys working the midnight to morning shift and would like to help insure that our community and the seniors who live here are safe and secure. This person will work Saturdays from midnight to 8:00 a.m. on Sunday and again on from Sunday at midnight to 8:00 a.m. on Monday. 

The Security Team Members at Pueblo Norte provide a combination of services, including:

    patrolling the community's parking areas, common areas, apartment areas, and buildings;   
    watching for strangers and other uninvited guests;
    checking to be sure doors are locked;
