        re-setting telephones.




Pueblo Norte, is owned and managed by Five Star Senior Living, one of the nation's largest senior care corporations. Our community is located near the major crossroads of Scottsdale Rd. and Shea Blvd. Our independent living apartments and villas, assisted living services and health care/long term care center are set in a campus which spans 22 beautifully landscaped acres.

Our Security Staff do not carry weapons.

